      "text": "Boxed warning:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " DHE with strong CYP3A4 inhibitors has caused serious and/or life-threatening peripheral ischemia (vasospasm causing cerebral or limb ischemia); it is contraindicated with them (eg, protease inhibitors such as ritonavir, macrolides such as erythromycin or clarithromycin, ketoconazole or itraconazole)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
